<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team. I'm sorry to hear that you've not received your preferred seat onboard our flights.</p>

<p><strong>Select your seats</strong><br />
To select your seat, enter your booking reference and last name, or if you’re a Qantas Frequent Flyer select your seat through&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/my-account" title="My Account">your bookings</a>:</p>

<p>For more information about seat selection refer to our <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/seat-selection.html">seating options</a> page or refer to our seating<a href="https://help.qantas.com/support/s/global-search/seat"> FAQs</a> .<br />
<br />
<em><strong>or</strong></em></p>

<p>As your query is regarding seating preferences stored in your Qantas Frequent Flyer membership, I've asked our Qantas Frequent Flyer Service Centre to review this.</p>

<p>They'll get in touch with you directly, but if you need to contact them, please call&nbsp; 13 11 31. Monday through Sunday between 7am - 7pm.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If offering goodwill gesture due to tier of Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a> to join free of charge.</p>
</body>
</html>